          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "OpenAI and Microsoft end exclusivity: OpenAI free to sell on AWS in exchange for revenue-share deal",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "OpenAI has secured major concessions from its largest investor Microsoft, dissolving the exclusive cloud-hosting arrangement and allowing OpenAI to sell its products on Amazon Web Services. In return, Microsoft receives an expanded revenue-share agreement, and OpenAI models including a new agent service became available on AWS Bedrock within 24 hours of the deal being announced. The move marks a fundamental shift in the cloud AI landscape, opening OpenAI's technology to a far broader base of enterprise customers.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/04/27/openai-ends-microsoft-legal-peril-over-its-50b-amazon-deal/",
            "publisher": {
